{
  "name": "MEGA·1 CONTENT FACTORY BRAIN — one Telegram command hub: AI image + Higgsfield video + ElevenLabs voice + omni-publish + campaigns",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {"content": "# 🧠 MEGA·1 — CONTENT FACTORY BRAIN\nOne workflow = your whole creative studio, driven from Telegram like a chat app.\n\n**COMMANDS (send to your bot):**\n• photo + `#studio` → Gemini re-shoots it as a pro studio image\n• photo + `#video your idea` → Higgsfield turns it into a showcase/UGC video\n• `#voice your script` → ElevenLabs speaks it (Kannada/English voice) — use under reels\n• photo + `#post caption…` → Cloudinary → Instagram + Facebook + Pinterest, confirmed back\n• `#campaign FestivalName` → Gemini writes the full campaign\n• anything else → help menu\n\n**KEYS (n8n → Settings → Variables):** GEMINI_API_KEY · HIGGSFIELD_API_KEY · ELEVENLABS_API_KEY · ELEVENLABS_VOICE_ID (pick a voice at elevenlabs.io/voice-library; Kannada-capable multilingual v2) · CLOUDINARY_CLOUD/PRESET · META_ACCESS_TOKEN · IG_USER_ID · FB_PAGE_ID · PIN_TOKEN/PIN_BOARD_ID · BRAND_NAME\n\n**🔧 Higgsfield note:** endpoint/payload follows their platform docs (platform.higgsfield.ai) — if your account's path differs, fix it ONLY in the two Higgsfield nodes (create + poll). Poll waits 60s; long videos may need a second run.", "height": 620, "width": 560},
      "id": "n0", "name": "README", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote", "typeVersion": 1, "position": [-640, -280]
    },
    {"parameters": {"updates": ["message"], "additionalFields": {"download": true, "imageSize": "extraLarge"}}, "id": "t1", "name": "Telegram: command in", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegramTrigger", "typeVersion": 1.1, "position": [0, 0], "credentials": {"telegramApi": {"id": "REPLACE", "name": "Jeweller Bot"}}},
    {
      "parameters": {"jsCode": "const m=$json.message||{};const text=(m.caption||m.text||'').trim();\nconst cmd=(text.match(/#(studio|video|voice|post|campaign)/i)||[])[1]?.toLowerCase()||'help';\nreturn [{ json: { cmd, text: text.replace(/#\\w+/,'').trim(), chat: m.chat.id, hasPhoto: !!m.photo }, binary: items[0].binary }];"},
      "id": "r1", "name": "Parse command", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code", "typeVersion": 2, "position": [200, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {"rules": {"values": [
        {"conditions": {"options": {}, "conditions": [{"leftValue": "={{$json.cmd}}", "rightValue": "studio", "operator": {"type": "string", "operation": "equals"}}], "combinator": "and"}, "renameOutput": true, "outputKey": "studio"},
        {"conditions": {"options": {}, "conditions": [{"leftValue": "={{$json.cmd}}", "rightValue": "video", "operator": {"type": "string", "operation": "equals"}}], "combinator": "and"}, "renameOutput": true, "outputKey": "video"},
        {"conditions": {"options": {}, "conditions": [{"leftValue": "={{$json.cmd}}", "rightValue": "voice", "operator": {"type": "string", "operation": "equals"}}], "combinator": "and"}, "renameOutput": true, "outputKey": "voice"},
        {"conditions": {"options": {}, "conditions": [{"leftValue": "={{$json.cmd}}", "rightValue": "post", "operator": {"type": "string", "operation": "equals"}}], "combinator": "and"}, "renameOutput": true, "outputKey": "post"},
        {"conditions": {"options": {}, "conditions": [{"leftValue": "={{$json.cmd}}", "rightValue": "campaign", "operator": {"type": "string", "operation": "equals"}}], "combinator": "and"}, "renameOutput": true, "outputKey": "campaign"}
      ]}, "options": {"fallbackOutput": "extra"}},
      "id": "sw", "name": "Route command", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.switch", "typeVersion": 3.2, "position": [400, 0]
    },
    {"parameters": {"content": "## A · #studio — AI STUDIO IMAGE (Gemini image model)", "height": 80, "width": 900}, "id": "sA", "name": "Section A", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote", "typeVersion": 1, "position": [620, -260]},
    {"parameters": {"jsCode": "const bin=items[0].binary?.data; if(!bin) throw new Error('Send a PHOTO with #studio');\nreturn [{ json: { body: { contents: [{ parts: [ { inlineData: { mimeType: bin.mimeType||'image/jpeg', data: bin.data } }, { text: 'Re-render this jewellery as a professional luxury studio product photograph: premium backdrop, soft key light, crisp jewellery focus, realistic, no text/people.' } ]}], generationConfig: { responseModalities: ['TEXT','IMAGE'] } } }, binary: items[0].binary }];"}, "id": "a1", "name": "A1 build image request", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code", "typeVersion": 2, "position": [640, -160]},
    {"parameters": {"method": "POST", "url": "=https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com/v1beta/models/gemini-2.5-flash-image:generateContent?key={{$env.GEMINI_API_KEY}}", "sendBody": true, "specifyBody": "json", "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify($json.body) }}", "options": {}}, "id": "a2", "name": "A2 Gemini: studio image", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest", "typeVersion": 4.2, "position": [840, -160]},
    {"parameters": {"jsCode": "const p=($json.candidates?.[0]?.content?.parts||[]).find(x=>x.inlineData);\nif(!p) throw new Error('No image returned — try again');\nreturn [{ json: {}, binary: { photo: { data: p.inlineData.data, mimeType: p.inlineData.mimeType||'image/png', fileName: 'studio.png' } } }];"}, "id": "a3", "name": "A3 extract image", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code", "typeVersion": 2, "position": [1040, -160]},
    {"parameters": {"operation": "sendPhoto", "chatId": "={{ $('Parse command').item.json.chat }}", "binaryData": true, "binaryPropertyName": "photo", "additionalFields": {"caption": "✨ Studio version. Reply with #post to publish, or #video to animate it."}}, "id": "a4", "name": "A4 send studio image", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram", "typeVersion": 1.2, "position": [1240, -160], "credentials": {"telegramApi": {"id": "REPLACE", "name": "Jeweller Bot"}}},
    {"parameters": {"content": "## B · #video — HIGGSFIELD image→video (UGC/showcase)", "height": 80, "width": 900}, "id": "sB", "name": "Section B", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote", "typeVersion": 1, "position": [620, -40]},
    {"parameters": {"method": "POST", "url": "=https://api.cloudinary.com/v1_1/{{$env.CLOUDINARY_CLOUD}}/image/upload", "contentType": "multipart-form-data", "sendBody": true, "bodyParameters": {"parameters": [{"name": "file", "parameterType": "formBinaryData", "inputDataFieldName": "data"}, {"name": "upload_preset", "value": "={{$env.CLOUDINARY_PRESET}}"}]}, "options": {}}, "id": "b1", "name": "B1 Cloudinary URL", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest", "typeVersion": 4.2, "position": [640, 60]},
    {
      "parameters": {"method": "POST", "url": "https://platform.higgsfield.ai/v1/image2video", "sendHeaders": true, "headerParameters": {"parameters": [{"name": "hf-api-key", "value": "={{$env.HIGGSFIELD_API_KEY}}"}]}, "sendBody": true, "specifyBody": "json", "jsonBody": "={ \"params\": { \"input_image\": { \"type\": \"image_url\", \"image_url\": {{ JSON.stringify($json.secure_url) }} }, \"prompt\": {{ JSON.stringify('Luxury jewellery showcase: slow elegant rotation, sparkling light glints, premium studio ambience. '+($('Parse command').item.json.text||'')) }}, \"motion_strength\": 0.6 } }", "options": {"response": {"response": {"neverError": true}}}},
      "id": "b2", "name": "B2 Higgsfield: create video job", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest", "typeVersion": 4.2, "position": [840, 60]
    },
    {"parameters": {"amount": 60}, "id": "b3", "name": "B3 wait 60s", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.wait", "typeVersion": 1.1, "position": [1040, 60]},
    {"parameters": {"url": "=https://platform.higgsfield.ai/v1/jobs/{{ $('B2 Higgsfield: create video job').item.json.id || $('B2 Higgsfield: create video job').item.json.job_id }}", "sendHeaders": true, "headerParameters": {"parameters": [{"name": "hf-api-key", "value": "={{$env.HIGGSFIELD_API_KEY}}"}]}, "options": {"response": {"response": {"neverError": true}}}}, "id": "b4", "name": "B4 Higgsfield: poll job", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest", "typeVersion": 4.2, "position": [1240, 60]},
    {"parameters": {"jsCode": "const j=$json; const url=j.result?.video_url||j.video_url||j.output?.url||(Array.isArray(j.results)?j.results[0]?.url:null);\nreturn [{ json: { url, status: j.status||'unknown' } }];"}, "id": "b5", "name": "B5 extract video url", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code", "typeVersion": 2, "position": [1440, 60]},
    {"parameters": {"operation": "sendMessage", "chatId": "={{ $('Parse command').item.json.chat }}", "text": "={{ $json.url ? '🎬 Your video is ready:\\n'+$json.url+'\\n\\nDownload & post as a reel, or send it back with #post.' : '⏳ Video still rendering (status: '+$json.status+') — send the same photo with #video again in 2 minutes.' }}", "additionalFields": {}}, "id": "b6", "name": "B6 send video link", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram", "typeVersion": 1.2, "position": [1640, 60], "credentials": {"telegramApi": {"id": "REPLACE", "name": "Jeweller Bot"}}},
    {"parameters": {"content": "## C · #voice — ELEVENLABS voiceover (Kannada/English)", "height": 80, "width": 900}, "id": "sC", "name": "Section C", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote", "typeVersion": 1, "position": [620, 200]},
    {
      "parameters": {"method": "POST", "url": "=https://api.elevenlabs.io/v1/text-to-speech/{{$env.ELEVENLABS_VOICE_ID}}", "sendHeaders": true, "headerParameters": {"parameters": [{"name": "xi-api-key", "value": "={{$env.ELEVENLABS_API_KEY}}"}]}, "sendBody": true, "specifyBody": "json", "jsonBody": "={ \"text\": {{ JSON.stringify($json.text || ('Namaste! Welcome to '+($env.BRAND_NAME||'our showroom'))) }}, \"model_id\": \"eleven_multilingual_v2\", \"voice_settings\": { \"stability\": 0.5, \"similarity_boost\": 0.75 } }", "options": {"response": {"response": {"responseFormat": "file", "outputPropertyName": "voice"}}}},
      "id": "c1", "name": "C1 ElevenLabs: TTS", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest", "typeVersion": 4.2, "position": [640, 300]
    },
    {"parameters": {"operation": "sendAudio", "chatId": "={{ $('Parse command').item.json.chat }}", "binaryData": true, "binaryPropertyName": "voice", "additionalFields": {"caption": "🎙️ Voiceover ready — drop it under your reel."}}, "id": "c2", "name": "C2 send voiceover", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram", "typeVersion": 1.2, "position": [840, 300], "credentials": {"telegramApi": {"id": "REPLACE", "name": "Jeweller Bot"}}},
    {"parameters": {"content": "## D · #post — OMNI-PUBLISH (Cloudinary → IG + FB + Pinterest, AI caption if none given)", "height": 80, "width": 1100}, "id": "sD", "name": "Section D", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote", "typeVersion": 1, "position": [620, 440]},
    {"parameters": {"method": "POST", "url": "=https://api.cloudinary.com/v1_1/{{$env.CLOUDINARY_CLOUD}}/image/upload", "contentType": "multipart-form-data", "sendBody": true, "bodyParameters": {"parameters": [{"name": "file", "parameterType": "formBinaryData", "inputDataFieldName": "data"}, {"name": "upload_preset", "value": "={{$env.CLOUDINARY_PRESET}}"}]}, "options": {}}, "id": "d1", "name": "D1 Cloudinary URL", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest", "typeVersion": 4.2, "position": [640, 540]},
    {
      "parameters": {"method": "POST", "url": "=https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com/v1beta/models/gemini-2.0-flash:generateContent?key={{$env.GEMINI_API_KEY}}", "sendBody": true, "specifyBody": "json", "jsonBody": "={ \"contents\": [{ \"parts\": [{ \"text\": \"Instagram caption for {{$env.BRAND_NAME}} (Indian gold jewellery). {{ $('Parse command').item.json.text ? 'Polish this caption, keep its meaning: '+$('Parse command').item.json.text : 'Write 2 warm premium lines' }} + 6 hashtags. Return caption only.\" }] }] }", "options": {}},
      "id": "d2", "name": "D2 Gemini: caption", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest", "typeVersion": 4.2, "position": [840, 540]
    },
    {"parameters": {"jsCode": "return [{ json: { url: $('D1 Cloudinary URL').item.json.secure_url, caption: $json.candidates[0].content.parts[0].text.trim() } }];"}, "id": "d3", "name": "D3 prep", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code", "typeVersion": 2, "position": [1040, 540]},
    {"parameters": {"method": "POST", "url": "=https://graph.facebook.com/v21.0/{{$env.IG_USER_ID}}/media", "sendBody": true, "specifyBody": "json", "jsonBody": "={ \"image_url\": {{ JSON.stringify($json.url) }}, \"caption\": {{ JSON.stringify($json.caption) }}, \"access_token\": \"{{$env.META_ACCESS_TOKEN}}\" }", "options": {}}, "id": "d4", "name": "D4 IG container", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest", "typeVersion": 4.2, "position": [1240, 480]},
    {"parameters": {"amount": 15}, "id": "d5", "name": "D5 wait 15s", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.wait", "typeVersion": 1.1, "position": [1420, 480]},
    {"parameters": {"method": "POST", "url": "=https://graph.facebook.com/v21.0/{{$env.IG_USER_ID}}/media_publish", "sendBody": true, "specifyBody": "json", "jsonBody": "={ \"creation_id\": \"{{$json.id}}\", \"access_token\": \"{{$env.META_ACCESS_TOKEN}}\" }", "options": {}}, "id": "d6", "name": "D6 IG publish", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest", "typeVersion": 4.2, "position": [1600, 480]},
    {"parameters": {"method": "POST", "url": "=https://graph.facebook.com/v21.0/{{$env.FB_PAGE_ID}}/photos", "sendBody": true, "specifyBody": "json", "jsonBody": "={ \"url\": {{ JSON.stringify($('D3 prep').item.json.url) }}, \"caption\": {{ JSON.stringify($('D3 prep').item.json.caption) }}, \"access_token\": \"{{$env.META_ACCESS_TOKEN}}\" }", "options": {}}, "id": "d7", "name": "D7 FB post", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest", "typeVersion": 4.2, "position": [1240, 600]},
    {"parameters": {"method": "POST", "url": "https://api.pinterest.com/v5/pins", "sendHeaders": true, "headerParameters": {"parameters": [{"name": "Authorization", "value": "=Bearer {{$env.PIN_TOKEN}}"}]}, "sendBody": true, "specifyBody": "json", "jsonBody": "={ \"board_id\": \"{{$env.PIN_BOARD_ID}}\", \"title\": {{ JSON.stringify($('D3 prep').item.json.caption.slice(0,90)) }}, \"media_source\": { \"source_type\": \"image_url\", \"url\": {{ JSON.stringify($('D3 prep').item.json.url) }} } }", "options": {"response": {"response": {"neverError": true}}}}, "id": "d8", "name": "D8 Pinterest pin", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest", "typeVersion": 4.2, "position": [1240, 720]},
    {"parameters": {"operation": "sendMessage", "chatId": "={{ $('Parse command').item.json.chat }}", "text": "=✅ Published everywhere!\n\nCaption used:\n{{ $('D3 prep').item.json.caption }}", "additionalFields": {}}, "id": "d9", "name": "D9 confirm publish", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram", "typeVersion": 1.2, "position": [1800, 600], "credentials": {"telegramApi": {"id": "REPLACE", "name": "Jeweller Bot"}}},
    {"parameters": {"content": "## E · #campaign — FULL AI CAMPAIGN  ·  F · HELP", "height": 80, "width": 900}, "id": "sE", "name": "Section E-F", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote", "typeVersion": 1, "position": [620, 860]},
    {
      "parameters": {"method": "POST", "url": "=https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com/v1beta/models/gemini-2.0-flash:generateContent?key={{$env.GEMINI_API_KEY}}", "sendBody": true, "specifyBody": "json", "jsonBody": "={ \"contents\": [{ \"parts\": [{ \"text\": \"Create a complete festive campaign for {{$env.BRAND_NAME}} (gold jewellery, Mysore) for: {{ JSON.stringify($json.text||'the next big festival') }}. Include offer idea, 3 teaser captions, 3 push captions, 1 last-call caption, a WhatsApp broadcast, an in-store line. Short, with hashtags.\" }] }] }", "options": {}},
      "id": "e1", "name": "E1 Gemini: campaign", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest", "typeVersion": 4.2, "position": [640, 960]
    },
    {"parameters": {"operation": "sendMessage", "chatId": "={{ $('Parse command').item.json.chat }}", "text": "=🪔 Campaign ready:\n\n{{ $json.candidates[0].content.parts[0].text.slice(0,3800) }}", "additionalFields": {}}, "id": "e2", "name": "E2 send campaign", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram", "typeVersion": 1.2, "position": [840, 960], "credentials": {"telegramApi": {"id": "REPLACE", "name": "Jeweller Bot"}}},
    {"parameters": {"operation": "sendMessage", "chatId": "={{$json.chat}}", "text": "=🧠 CONTENT FACTORY — commands:\n📸 photo + #studio → pro studio image\n🎬 photo + #video idea → AI video\n🎙️ #voice script → voiceover audio\n📤 photo + #post caption → IG+FB+Pinterest\n🪔 #campaign Diwali → full campaign\n\nJust send a photo with a command!", "additionalFields": {}}, "id": "f1", "name": "F1 help", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram", "typeVersion": 1.2, "position": [640, 1100], "credentials": {"telegramApi": {"id": "REPLACE", "name": "Jeweller Bot"}}}
  ],
